# kip-sdk is built and CI-tested across Linux/macOS/Windows. Line endings are normalized to LF for
# text sources so a Windows checkout can never re-commit CRLF blobs (which show as whole-file diffs
# and defeat cross-OS review). See docs/DEBTS.md / project note "CRLF on changed files".
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.tsx  text eol=lf
*.mts  text eol=lf
*.cts  text eol=lf
*.js   text eol=lf
*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.mjs  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
